  [
    "Block",
    {
      "type_": "variable",
      "labels": [ [ "Lit", "rules" ] ],
      "body": [
        [
          "Attribute",
          "description",
          [
            "Heredoc",
            [
              "EOF",
              "\nA map of rules for the Application Gateway. A rule combines backend's, listener's, rewrites' and redirects' configurations.\n\nA key is an application name that is used to prefix all components inside an Application Gateway\nthat are created for this application.\n\nEvery rule contains following attributes:\n\n- `name`             - (`string`, required) Rule name.\n- `priority`         - (`string`, required) Rule evaluation order can be dictated by specifying an integer value from 1 to \n                       20000 with 1 being the highest priority and 20000 being the lowest priority.\n- `listener_key`     - (`string`, required) a key identifying a listener config defined in `var.listeners`.\n- `backend_key`      - (`string`, optional, mutually exclusive with `url_path_map_key` and `redirect_key`) a key identifying a\n                       backend config defined in `var.backend_settings`.\n- `rewrite_key`      - (`string`, optional, defaults to `null`) a key identifying a rewrite config defined in `var.rewrites`.\n- `url_path_map_key` - (`string`, optional, mutually exclusive with `backend_key` and `redirect_key`) a key identifying a\n                       url_path_map config defined in `var.url_path_maps`.\n- `redirect_key`     - (`string`, optional, mutually exclusive with `url_path_map_key` and `backend_key`) a key identifying a\n                       redirect config defined in `var.redirects`.\n"
            ]
          ]
        ],
        [
          "Attribute",
          "type",
          [
            "Fun_call",
            [
              "map",
